# Local configuration and secrets
# Ignore every local dotenv variant at the root or in a nested project. Only the
# sanitized examples are versionable.
.env*
**/.env*
*.env
*.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
.direnv/
**/local.settings.json
!**/local.settings.example.json
secrets.json
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem

